applying result after Int64
applying ownedBy none
applying cleanedBy none
applying borrows none
applying catch problem LedgerError
applying suppresses none

writeLead is call
writeLead rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeLead in main
writeLead invokes console.write
writeLead argument text String balanceText lend
writeLead result none
writeLead ownedBy none
writeLead cleanedBy none
writeLead borrows none
writeLead catch writeLeadError console.WriteError
writeLead suppresses console.WriteError.failed

writeBalance is call
writeBalance rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeBalance in main
writeBalance invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeBalance argument value Int64 balance copy
writeBalance result none
writeBalance ownedBy none
writeBalance cleanedBy none
writeBalance borrows none
writeBalance catch writeBalanceError console.WriteError
writeBalance suppresses console.WriteError.failed

